*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : LON0040
*> PURPOSE : LOAN LIMITS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : L.B.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1992-02-14 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2003-10-08 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 465
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB LONNIGHT STEP050
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. LON0040.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-INPUT.
    *> YEARS WITH CURRENT EMPLOYER
    05 JOB-TENURE         PIC 9(2).
    05 ANNUAL-INCOME      PIC 9(7)V99.
01 WS-RESULTS.
    05 MAX-LOAN-AMT       PIC 9(9)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAINLINE.
    ACCEPT WS-INPUT
    PERFORM MAX-LOAN-CALC
    DISPLAY "MAX-LOAN-AMT=" MAX-LOAN-AMT
    STOP RUN.
MAX-LOAN-CALC.
    *>  OLD CHECK REMOVED 1996
    *>  IF JOB-TENURE >= 5
    *>      PERFORM 9000-OLD-HANDLING
    *>  END-IF
    *> ESTABLISHED EMPLOYMENT MULTIPLE
    IF JOB-TENURE GREATER THAN OR EQUAL TO 7
        COMPUTE MAX-LOAN-AMT = ANNUAL-INCOME * 4
    ELSE
        *> STANDARD EMPLOYMENT MULTIPLE
        IF JOB-TENURE NOT < 3
            COMPUTE MAX-LOAN-AMT = ANNUAL-INCOME * 3
        ELSE
            COMPUTE MAX-LOAN-AMT ROUNDED = ANNUAL-INCOME * 1.5
        END-IF
    END-IF.
